# Internal docs

Ops notes, deploy checklists, OAuth steps, and other non-public writing go in `internal/` as plain Markdown.

Do not put them in `src/content/docs/`, `src/content/blog/`, `src/pages/`, or `public/`. Those paths are published. `draft: true` still leaves the file in the public content tree; use `internal/` instead.

Do not import `astro-pure/user` MDX components in `internal/` — that folder is not compiled by Astro.
